<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab fighters captured a village near Mataban in central Somalia and seized Coomaad in Hirshabelle, prompting protests against the regional election. In Minnesota, Somali-American Uber driver Mohamed Yusuf was brutally assaulted, left in critical condition after a passenger beat him, stole his car and ran him over. A Somali refugee woman was killed by Houthi shelling of a camp in Lahj, and militia forces killed eight Somali civilians near the Kenya-Ethiopia border. Heavy rainstorms in Lower Shabelle killed a mother and two children. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQM0QzRGZIakk0QkFFVk9xNk9YZ1Y3QW1aVTIzbm9ual9Qb2JzNDdja05Vb1ZZZGRoLVR2dS1tN1lfY0xRSTg4c1BoMVRndExjUDJ3dUdiX3Q4dS1FUjJDODJIVGQ2SXk2SUhaMlRTTVFxeGxJamE3ZHRyZ2hzVHlHM2tBVHdlV2N1U0llRlphaEdYTjVwb1NJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOVVpLZFNEV2paZDFnNnJWc3JCYk5mZXlGQ241eGIxSHY5ZUU0ZTQ1Q1I4MjVfSXZHUjJfMzdqaUJ4cE82QUhuUEEzUFhhTk5tQXk3SjhWM2xWaEVTaUZXZk5hdGdYazZ6dHNicUQzbE9WMlhHT2VGeDN6WHpBTzRFcDZwQXhiN3kwSC1YZHBhb1ZkbkE3eFd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQbDlWMzN3N1FKSE0weXNWQ0JiRXR2bHQ2eG04ZHhUdzNJRTlzc3JLYURzbVExdXZGdlFraGlJSDZ2dVNTdER4cHBMbG1CQTFvYjVQMDM3cTRJelVaM0VjUkhKSVEtd3M0SXRRRzhSWTBaTmludE9mUGRKRmdhN19RSGFwQ19pQVNGNjhtZHRyOGkxa2pJWmp1aWdVVjFMalRmU3lMOE5uQko2TG5veG9YeEFuQnktTlExeXNBWTNQWlJkbUNnbTRoUllR?oc=5&quot;&gt;صوت الإمارات&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE5RNlJYRXdSVENMMG1udmpsMkRxbmJmUXRFUjhva3dDQ1l0ZG1tX3MyR0NoRVU3TW80QVE2MFQzZUlxbDRzMFd4QzhkRDhBRWY1QWNpNGpXdk5lNWg3SFlFSkxvcEVHUFRoQXRoQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hr